hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1004","Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi told us, Abu Muawiyah told us, on the authority of Al-A’mash, on the authority of Abu Sufyan, on the authority of Jabir, on the authority of Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri.” “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, prayed on a mat.”"
